			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Amounts reported in this table represent the amounts earned by each non-employee director for their service on the Company&#8217;s Board during the year ended June 30, 2026, of which two directors were paid in shares of Common Stock and two were paid in cash. The amounts in this column represent the aggregate grant date fair value of the shares of Common Stock issued to each non-employee director, calculated in accordance with Financial Accounting Standards Board (&#8220;<i>FASB</i>&#8221;) Accounting Standards Codification (&#8220;<i>ASC</i>&#8221;) Topic 718.</p>
			</td>
