			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">John R. Merrill and Edward L. Clissold were the Company's Non-PEO NEOs during each of the fiscal years presented. Amounts shown represent the average Summary Compensation Table total and average compensation actually paid to Messrs. Merrill and Clissold for the applicable fiscal year.</p>
