			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Represents the cumulative total shareholder return of a fixed investment of $100 in the Company's Common Stock at June 30, 2023, calculated through the end of the applicable fiscal year and assuming reinvestment of dividends.</p>
