			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Includes 587,476 shares of Common Stock held in trust, in which Mr. Allen is the trustee.</p>
			</td>
